Category: implementation-specific. "tagged_variant_schema_tests" and "shared_ptr variant schema"
expect the schema's title to be the reflected name of std::variant as GCC prints it with
libstdc++ (std::variant<...>), or unqualified as Bloomberg's Clang prints it. GCC's
display_string_of names an inline namespace, and libycxx's is std::__y1 (DECISIONS §20.4):
std::__y1::variant<put_action, delete_action>. With a library other than libstdc++ and libc++
the test leaves the inline namespace out of the names before comparing.

diff --git a/tests/json_test/json_variant_support_test.cpp b/tests/json_test/json_variant_support_test.cpp
index 09b9252..99ff702 100644
